<title>USA: U.S. debt futures end down in quiet trading.</title>
<headline>U.S. debt futures end down in quiet trading.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 21 - U.S. debt futures ended lower in very quiet trade. Market on defensive ahead of Humphrey-Hawkins testimony, supply Tuesday and Wednesday. Sept T-bond posts tight range, Euros even tighter. Traders say followthrough profit-taking after Friday contributed to lackluster day.</p>
